<x-layouts.public title="About Us" description="Learn why Ideyra is being built: to connect student ideas, collaborative projects and professional growth while respecting personal ownership.">
<x-marketing.intro eyebrow="ABOUT IDEYRA" title="Potential needs a place to grow.">We’re building a student-centred platform where ideas, projects and future possibilities can become part of one meaningful journey.</x-marketing.intro>
<section class="container section-topless editorial-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE PROBLEM WE SEE</p><h2>Good thinking gets lost<br>between disconnected tools.</h2></div><div><p>An idea starts in a notebook. A project moves into a chat. An opportunity lives in a browser tab. The work gets done, but the story of how you grew can be difficult to see.</p><p>Ideyra’s purpose is to bring that journey into focus. We’re designing one connected environment for independent thinking, shared work and professional development, with institutional organisation where it belongs.</p></div></section>
<section class="institution-section"><div class="container dual-use"><div><p class="eyebrow">OUR VISION</p><h2>More students turning<br>potential into progress.</h2><p>A world where students have the structure, connections and confidence to develop ideas and carry their achievements into the next stage of their lives.</p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">OUR MISSION</p><h2>Connect the work.<br>Make growth visible.</h2><p>Build thoughtful tools that help students capture ideas, develop projects, work with others and express what they’ve learned — while giving institutions a clear way to support that progress.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section container"><x-marketing.heading eyebrow="PRINCIPLES THAT GUIDE US" title="Thoughtful foundations. Clear boundaries.">The way a platform handles ownership and access matters as much as the tools it provides.</x-marketing.heading><div class="feature-grid"><x-marketing.feature number="01 / OWNERSHIP" title="Personal means personal." status="Design principle">Personal work will stay private by default. Joining an institution must not automatically expose your independent ideas or projects.</x-marketing.feature><x-marketing.feature number="02 / CLARITY" title="Progress over clutter." status="Design principle">Practical tools, clear next steps and accessible experiences should support the work without getting in its way.</x-marketing.feature><x-marketing.feature number="03 / CONNECTION" title="Participation by choice." status="Design principle">A person can belong to more than one institution while keeping an independent workspace and control over explicit sharing.</x-marketing.feature></div></section>
<section class="container editorial-grid section-topless"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHO WE’RE BUILDING FOR</p><h2>Independent minds.<br>Connected communities.</h2></div><div><p>Students exploring their interests. Project groups building together. Lecturers and supervisors guiding academic work. Institutions organising the environments where learning and innovation happen.</p><p>These are the communities our roadmap serves. Institution applications, authorised account access and contact enquiries are available today; the personal and institutional product modules are still being developed.</p></div></section>
<x-marketing.narrative />
<x-marketing.cta title="See where the vision is going.">Explore our feature roadmap and recommend Ideyra to your institution as the foundation takes shape.</x-marketing.cta>
